</strong><div class="sub">of negative feedback</div></div></div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>Recent themes</h3><span>Auto-clustered</span></div><div style="display:grid;gap:8px"><div class="tag">“Rice portion is too large” · 36 mentions</div><div class="tag">“Sauce is too salty” · 27 mentions</div><div class="tag">“Can I get less rice?” · 22 mentions</div></div><button class="action primary" style="margin-top:14px" onclick="showModal('Student feedback evidence','<p>Student Voice is one of FoodLoop’s decision inputs. It is combined with consumption and waste signals so the system can distinguish “students do not like this meal” from “students like it, but the portion is too large.”</p>')">View evidence</button></div></div><div class="section-title"><h3>You said → We changed</h3><span>Closed-loop feedback</span></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Rice portion</h4><p>Students asked for smaller servings.</p></div><span class="pill green">Implemented</span></div><div class="cards3" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="mini"><b>You said</b><strong>75%</strong><div class="sub">wanted another portion option</div></div><div class="mini"><b>We changed</b><strong>−10%</strong><div class="sub">regular rice portion</div></div><div class="mini"><b>Observed</b><strong>−14%</strong><div class="sub">waste in pilot data</div></div></div></div>`,
insights:()=>`<div class="section-title"><h3>Waste & Insights</h3><span>Last 6 weeks</span></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Waste by meal</h4><p>Returned food as % of served volume</p></div><div class="filters"><select><option>All meals</option><option>Pasta</option><option>Greens</option></select><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Filters applied')">Apply</button></div></div><table class="table" style="margin-top:12px"><thead><tr><th>Meal</th><th>Return rate</th><th>Trend</th><th>Main signal</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${data.waste.map((r,i)=>`<tr><td>${r[0]}</td><td><b>${r[1]}%</b></td><td><span class="pill ${r[1]>15?'red':r[1]>10?'amber':'green'}">${r[1]>15?'↑ high':r[1]>10?'↑ watch':'stable'}</span></td><td>${i===0?'Sauce / taste':i===1?'Portion size':i===2?'Portion size':'No clear signal'}</td><td><button class="action" onclick="openEvidence('${r[0]}')">Why?</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="section-title"><h3>Root cause signals</h3><span>Evidence-backed</span></div><div class="cards2"><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Pasta</h4><p>Return rate 14.4%</p></div><span class="pill red">High</span></div><div class="insight" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Likely cause</strong><span>62% of returned pasta is sauce. Student comments mention taste. FoodLoop recommends testing a new sauce before changing the whole meal.</span></div><button class="action primary" style="margin-top:12px" onclick="setView('simulator')">Test response</button></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Greens</h4><p>Return rate 19.2%</p></div><span class="pill amber">Medium</span></div><div class="insight" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Likely cause</strong><span>Tuesday return volume is high, and smaller portion requests appear frequently in Student Voice.</span></div><button class="action" style="margin-top:12px" onclick="setView('simulator')">Compare portions</button></div></div><div class="section-title"><h3>Recommendation evidence</h3><span>Click to inspect</span></div><div class="cards3"><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Pasta sauce</div><div class="value blue" style="font-size:21px">High</div><div class="sub">6 weeks + 428 responses</div></div><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Greens portion</div><div class="value warning" style="font-size:21px">Medium</div><div class="sub">3 Tuesday services</div></div><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Soup prep</div><div class="value warning" style="font-size:21px">Medium</div><div class="sub">5 services</div></div></div>`,
nutrition:()=>`<div class="section-title"><h3>Nutrition</h3><span>Tomorrow's menu</span></div><div class="grid cols equal"><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Meal balance</h4><p>Nutrition is a guardrail for every FoodLoop decision.</p></div><span class="pill green">On target</span></div><div class="value" style="font-size:36px">91<span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">/100</span></div><div style="margin-top:14px;display:grid;gap:12px">${[['Protein',88],['Vegetables',84],['Whole grains',72],['Variety',91]].map(x=>`<div><div class="row"><span class="tiny">${x[0]}</span><span class="tiny">${x[1]}</span></div><div class="progress" style="margin-top:6px"><i style="width:${x[1]}%"></i></div></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Meal rules</h4><p>Every proposed change is checked before approval.</p></div><span class="pill blue">Active</span></div><div class="tradeoff" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="guard ok"><b>Protein</b><strong>≥ 25g</strong></div><div class="guard ok"><b>Vegetables</b><strong>≥ 1 serving</strong></div><div class="guard ok"><b>Whole grains</b><strong>≥ 1 serving</strong></div><div class="guard ok"><b>Balance score</b><strong>≥ 90</strong></div></div><div class="recommend-box" style="margin-top:14px"><h4>Why this matters</h4><p>FoodLoop may reduce waste, change a recipe or adjust a serving size — but it cannot recommend an option that falls outside the school's nutrition rules.</p></div></div></div><div class="section-title"><h3>Latest check</h3><span>Before-serving validation</span></div><div class="card hero"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Waste</th><th>Acceptance</th><th>Nutrition</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Current plan</td><td>12.0%</td><td>84%</td><td>91</td><td><span class="pill green">Pass</span></td></tr><tr><td>Smaller portion</td><td>9.7%</td><td>82%</td><td>89</td><td><span class="pill red">Blocked</span></td></tr><tr><td>New sauce recipe</td><td>8.9%</td><td>84%</td><td>92</td><td><span class="pill green">Pass</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>`,
inventory:()=>`<div class="section-title"><h3>Inventory</h3><span>Today · 16 tracked ingredients</span></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Items needing attention</h4><p>Use, move or adjust tomorrow's prep.</p></div><span class="pill amber">2 items</span></div><table class="table" style="margin-top:12px"><thead><tr><th>Ingredient</th><th>Stock</th><th>Expected use</th><th>Expiry</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tomato sauce</td><td>18 kg</td><td>12 kg</td><td><span class="pill amber">Tomorrow</span></td><td><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Tomato sauce moved to priority use')">Prioritize</button></td></tr><tr><td>Leafy greens</td><td>22 kg</td><td>18 kg</td><td><span class="pill green">3 days</span></td><td><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Inventory reviewed')">Review</button></td></tr><tr><td>Chicken</td><td>46 kg</td><td>39 kg</td><td><span class="pill green">4 days</span></td><td><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Inventory reviewed')">Review</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="section-title"><h3>Procurement signals</h3><span>Next 3 days</span></div><div class="cards3"><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Buy more</div><div class="value" style="font-size:22px">2</div><div class="sub">Ingredients</div></div><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Use first</div><div class="value warning" style="font-size:22px">1</div><div class="sub">Ingredient</div></div><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Stable</div><div class="value positive" style="font-size:22px">14</div><div class="sub">Ingredients</div></div></div>`,